{"seq":1,"slug":"projectile-collision","title":"投射物碰撞：连续检测与穿墙的隐蔽 bug","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-projectile-ballistics/collision/projectile-collision","wordCount":1506,"readingTime":7,"html":"<h1 id=\"投射物碰撞-连续检测与穿墙的隐蔽-bug\">投射物碰撞：连续检测与穿墙的隐蔽 bug</h1><p>有一类 bug 让无数射击游戏程序员抓狂：明明准星对准了敌人，子弹却「穿」了过去，命中判定丢失。原因几乎总是同一个——投射物速度太快，一帧位移就跨过了目标或墙壁，而离散的碰撞检测只在每帧的固定位置采样，恰好错过了两帧之间的接触。这篇讲怎么可靠地检测高速投射物的命中：为什么离散检测会漏、连续碰撞检测（CCD）如何补上、以及投射物场景下的实用取舍。底层的 CCD 算法本身属于<a href=\"../../game-physics/collision-detection/continuous-detection\">游戏物理</a>，这篇聚焦「投射物这一特定物体如何应用它」。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-隧穿-离散检测的致命缺陷\">核心概念：隧穿，离散检测的致命缺陷</h2><p>设想一颗子弹以每帧 30 米的速度飞行，前方 5 米处有一堵 0.2 米厚的墙。第 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span></span></span> 帧子弹在墙前 3 米，第 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n+1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span></span> 帧它已经飞到墙后 27 米——两帧的采样点都不在墙内，离散碰撞检测查询这两个位置时都报「无碰撞」，子弹就这么穿墙而过。这就是隧穿（tunneling）。</p>\n<p>隧穿的发生条件很明确：<strong>当单帧位移大于目标最小厚度时</strong>，离散采样就可能漏检。物体越快、目标越薄、帧率越低，越容易发生。投射物恰好是「又快又常打薄目标（人体碰撞盒、栏杆、墙）」的重灾区，所以弹道系统几乎必须处理它。</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>隧穿风险</mtext><mtext>  </mtext><mo>⟺</mo><mtext>  </mtext><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>v</mi><mo>⃗</mo></mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mi>t</mi><mo>&gt;</mo><msub><mi>d</mi><mrow><mi>m</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>n</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{隧穿风险} \\iff |\\vec{v}|\\,\\Delta t &gt; d_{min}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7073em;vertical-align:-0.024em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">隧穿风险</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">⟺</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.714em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.2077em;\"><span class=\"overlay\" style=\"height:0.714em;width:0.471em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"0.471em\" height=\"0.714em\" style=\"width:0.471em\" viewBox=\"0 0 471 714\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMinYMin\"><path d=\"M377 20c0-5.333 1.833-10 5.5-14S391 0 397 0c4.667 0 8.667 1.667 12 5\n3.333 2.667 6.667 9 10 19 6.667 24.667 20.333 43.667 41 57 7.333 4.667 11\n10.667 11 18 0 6-1 10-3 12s-6.667 5-14 9c-28.667 14.667-53.667 35.667-75 63\n-1.333 1.333-3.167 3.5-5.5 6.5s-4 4.833-5 5.5c-1 .667-2.5 1.333-4.5 2s-4.333 1\n-7 1c-4.667 0-9.167-1.833-13.5-5.5S337 184 337 178c0-12.667 15.667-32.333 47-59\nH213l-171-1c-8.667-6-13-12.333-13-19 0-4.667 4.333-11.333 13-20h359\nc-16-25.333-24-45-24-59z\"/></svg></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&gt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8444em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">min</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>d</mi><mrow><mi>m</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>n</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">d_{min}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8444em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">min</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是目标沿运动方向的最小尺寸。这个不等式解释了为什么慢速手雷可以用离散检测，而高速步枪弹不能。</p>\n<h2 id=\"连续碰撞检测-检查整段路径\">连续碰撞检测：检查整段路径</h2><p>CCD 的核心思想极简单：不要只查两帧的端点位置，而要查这两点之间的<strong>整条线段</strong>有没有撞到东西。子弹从 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>p</mi><mo>⃗</mo></mover><mrow><mi>p</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>v</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\vec{p}_{prev}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0001em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.714em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.1522em;\"><span class=\"overlay\" style=\"height:0.714em;width:0.471em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"0.471em\" height=\"0.714em\" style=\"width:0.471em\" viewBox=\"0 0 471 714\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMinYMin\"><path d=\"M377 20c0-5.333 1.833-10 5.5-14S391 0 397 0c4.667 0 8.667 1.667 12 5\n3.333 2.667 6.667 9 10 19 6.667 24.667 20.333 43.667 41 57 7.333 4.667 11\n10.667 11 18 0 6-1 10-3 12s-6.667 5-14 9c-28.667 14.667-53.667 35.667-75 63\n-1.333 1.333-3.167 3.5-5.5 6.5s-4 4.833-5 5.5c-1 .667-2.5 1.333-4.5 2s-4.333 1\n-7 1c-4.667 0-9.167-1.833-13.5-5.5S337 184 337 178c0-12.667 15.667-32.333 47-59\nH213l-171-1c-8.667-6-13-12.333-13-19 0-4.667 4.333-11.333 13-20h359\nc-16-25.333-24-45-24-59z\"/></svg></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1944em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 飞到 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>p</mi><mo>⃗</mo></mover></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\vec{p}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9084em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.714em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.1522em;\"><span class=\"overlay\" style=\"height:0.714em;width:0.471em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"0.471em\" height=\"0.714em\" style=\"width:0.471em\" viewBox=\"0 0 471 714\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMinYMin\"><path d=\"M377 20c0-5.333 1.833-10 5.5-14S391 0 397 0c4.667 0 8.667 1.667 12 5\n3.333 2.667 6.667 9 10 19 6.667 24.667 20.333 43.667 41 57 7.333 4.667 11\n10.667 11 18 0 6-1 10-3 12s-6.667 5-14 9c-28.667 14.667-53.667 35.667-75 63\n-1.333 1.333-3.167 3.5-5.5 6.5s-4 4.833-5 5.5c-1 .667-2.5 1.333-4.5 2s-4.333 1\n-7 1c-4.667 0-9.167-1.833-13.5-5.5S337 184 337 178c0-12.667 15.667-32.333 47-59\nH213l-171-1c-8.667-6-13-12.333-13-19 0-4.667 4.333-11.333 13-20h359\nc-16-25.333-24-45-24-59z\"/></svg></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1944em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，就沿这段线段做一次射线投射，问物理世界「这条线第一个撞到谁、在哪」。因为覆盖了整段路径，无论墙多薄都不会漏。这也正是<a href=\"../foundations/projectile-model\">数据模型</a>里坚持保留 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>p</mi><mo>⃗</mo></mover><mrow><mi>p</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>v</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\vec{p}_{prev}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0001em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.714em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.1522em;\"><span class=\"overlay\" style=\"height:0.714em;width:0.471em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"0.471em\" height=\"0.714em\" style=\"width:0.471em\" viewBox=\"0 0 471 714\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMinYMin\"><path d=\"M377 20c0-5.333 1.833-10 5.5-14S391 0 397 0c4.667 0 8.667 1.667 12 5\n3.333 2.667 6.667 9 10 19 6.667 24.667 20.333 43.667 41 57 7.333 4.667 11\n10.667 11 18 0 6-1 10-3 12s-6.667 5-14 9c-28.667 14.667-53.667 35.667-75 63\n-1.333 1.333-3.167 3.5-5.5 6.5s-4 4.833-5 5.5c-1 .667-2.5 1.333-4.5 2s-4.333 1\n-7 1c-4.667 0-9.167-1.833-13.5-5.5S337 184 337 178c0-12.667 15.667-32.333 47-59\nH213l-171-1c-8.667-6-13-12.333-13-19 0-4.667 4.333-11.333 13-20h359\nc-16-25.333-24-45-24-59z\"/></svg></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1944em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 的理由。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    A[本帧积分完成&lt;br/&gt;得到 p_prev 和 p] --&gt; B[沿 p_prev→p 做射线/扫掠查询]&#10;    B --&gt; C{路径上有命中?}&#10;    C --&gt;|否| D[投射物安全推进到 p]&#10;    C --&gt;|是| E[取最近命中点与法线]&#10;    E --&gt; F[把投射物位置回退到命中点]&#10;    F --&gt; G[触发命中响应&lt;br/&gt;穿透/跳弹/停止]&#10;    D --&gt; H[下一帧]\">flowchart TD\n    A[本帧积分完成&lt;br/&gt;得到 p_prev 和 p] --&gt; B[沿 p_prev→p 做射线/扫掠查询]\n    B --&gt; C{路径上有命中?}\n    C --&gt;|否| D[投射物安全推进到 p]\n    C --&gt;|是| E[取最近命中点与法线]\n    E --&gt; F[把投射物位置回退到命中点]\n    F --&gt; G[触发命中响应&lt;br/&gt;穿透/跳弹/停止]\n    D --&gt; H[下一帧]</pre><p>对有体积的投射物（火箭弹、能量球），单条射线不够，要用<strong>扫掠体检测</strong>（shapecast / sweep）——让一个球或胶囊沿路径扫过，检测这个扫掠体与世界的接触。射线是扫掠的零半径特例。绝大多数引擎都提供 <code>LineTraceSingle</code> / <code>SweepSingle</code>（Unreal）或 <code>Raycast</code> / <code>SphereCast</code>（Unity）这类现成 API，弹道系统直接调用即可，不必自己实现 CCD 算法。</p>\n<h2 id=\"检测策略的层次与取舍\">检测策略的层次与取舍</h2><p>不是所有投射物都要开销最大的连续检测，实践中按需分层：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>策略</th>\n<th>开销</th>\n<th>可靠性</th>\n<th>适用投射物</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>离散点查询</td>\n<td>最低</td>\n<td>会隧穿</td>\n<td>慢速大体积（手雷）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>射线 CCD</td>\n<td>低</td>\n<td>不隧穿（点）</td>\n<td>快速小弹（步枪、狙击）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>扫掠体 CCD</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>不隧穿（有体积）</td>\n<td>快速大弹（火箭、能量球）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>子步进 CCD</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>极可靠（含曲线）</td>\n<td>高速+急转（制导弹）</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><strong>子步进</strong>（sub-stepping）是给曲线运动准备的：一颗高速制导弹在一帧内既快速平移又大幅转向，单条直线段无法代表它的弯曲路径，于是把这一帧切成若干小步，每小步单独做一次 CCD。Unreal 的 <code>UProjectileMovementComponent</code> 就内置了这套机制——文档说明当投射物受重力或追踪目标时会自动启用子步进，并可通过 <code>Max Simulation Iterations</code> 控制每步最大迭代次数以在精度与性能间权衡（<a href=\"https://dev.epicgames.com/documentation/en-us/unreal-engine/API/Runtime/Engine/UProjectileMovementComponent\">Epic 官方文档</a>）。选哪档，回到那条隧穿不等式：位移够小、目标够厚就用便宜的，反之升级。</p>\n<h2 id=\"该撞谁-过滤-自伤与首帧问题\">该撞谁：过滤、自伤与首帧问题</h2><p>检测到命中只是几何问题，还要判断「这个命中算不算数」，这是投射物特有的一堆坑：</p>\n<p><strong>碰撞过滤</strong>：子弹不该被自己的曳光特效、其它友方投射物挡住，要用碰撞层/掩码把投射物只与「可命中目标」和「阻挡物」求交，忽略无关物体。这依赖底层的<a href=\"../../game-physics/collision-detection/bounding-volumes\">碰撞层设置</a>。</p>\n<p><strong>自伤与发射者</strong>：投射物生成时往往就嵌在发射者的碰撞盒里，第一帧的 CCD 很容易「命中自己」。标准解法是用<a href=\"../foundations/projectile-model\">数据模型</a>里存的发射者 ID，在检测时忽略发射者（或在近距离武器上故意允许自伤——如贴脸榴弹）。</p>\n<p><strong>首帧枪口位置</strong>：投射物到底从枪口冒出，还是从摄像机/准星发出？两者不一致会导致「准星对准了但子弹被枪口前的掩体挡住」，即所谓 muzzle-vs-camera 问题。常见折中是先从摄像机做一次判定确定真实瞄准点，再让可见投射物从枪口飞向该点——这也解释了为何很多游戏子弹看起来是斜着飞的。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>隧穿是投射物命中丢失的头号原因：当单帧位移大于目标最小厚度（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>v</mi><mo>⃗</mo></mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mi>t</mi><mo>&gt;</mo><msub><mi>d</mi><mrow><mi>m</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>n</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">|\\vec v|\\Delta t &gt; d_{min}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.714em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.2077em;\"><span class=\"overlay\" style=\"height:0.714em;width:0.471em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"0.471em\" height=\"0.714em\" style=\"width:0.471em\" viewBox=\"0 0 471 714\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMinYMin\"><path d=\"M377 20c0-5.333 1.833-10 5.5-14S391 0 397 0c4.667 0 8.667 1.667 12 5\n3.333 2.667 6.667 9 10 19 6.667 24.667 20.333 43.667 41 57 7.333 4.667 11\n10.667 11 18 0 6-1 10-3 12s-6.667 5-14 9c-28.667 14.667-53.667 35.667-75 63\n-1.333 1.333-3.167 3.5-5.5 6.5s-4 4.833-5 5.5c-1 .667-2.5 1.333-4.5 2s-4.333 1\n-7 1c-4.667 0-9.167-1.833-13.5-5.5S337 184 337 178c0-12.667 15.667-32.333 47-59\nH213l-171-1c-8.667-6-13-12.333-13-19 0-4.667 4.333-11.333 13-20h359\nc-16-25.333-24-45-24-59z\"/></svg></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\">∣Δ</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&gt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8444em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">min</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>）时，离散点采样会漏检。</li>\n<li>连续碰撞检测沿 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>p</mi><mo>⃗</mo></mover><mrow><mi>p</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>v</mi></mrow></msub><mo>→</mo><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>p</mi><mo>⃗</mo></mover></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\vec{p}_{prev}\\to\\vec{p}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0001em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.714em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.1522em;\"><span class=\"overlay\" style=\"height:0.714em;width:0.471em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"0.471em\" height=\"0.714em\" style=\"width:0.471em\" viewBox=\"0 0 471 714\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMinYMin\"><path d=\"M377 20c0-5.333 1.833-10 5.5-14S391 0 397 0c4.667 0 8.667 1.667 12 5\n3.333 2.667 6.667 9 10 19 6.667 24.667 20.333 43.667 41 57 7.333 4.667 11\n10.667 11 18 0 6-1 10-3 12s-6.667 5-14 9c-28.667 14.667-53.667 35.667-75 63\n-1.333 1.333-3.167 3.5-5.5 6.5s-4 4.833-5 5.5c-1 .667-2.5 1.333-4.5 2s-4.333 1\n-7 1c-4.667 0-9.167-1.833-13.5-5.5S337 184 337 178c0-12.667 15.667-32.333 47-59\nH213l-171-1c-8.667-6-13-12.333-13-19 0-4.667 4.333-11.333 13-20h359\nc-16-25.333-24-45-24-59z\"/></svg></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1944em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">→</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9084em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.714em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.1522em;\"><span class=\"overlay\" style=\"height:0.714em;width:0.471em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"0.471em\" height=\"0.714em\" style=\"width:0.471em\" viewBox=\"0 0 471 714\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMinYMin\"><path d=\"M377 20c0-5.333 1.833-10 5.5-14S391 0 397 0c4.667 0 8.667 1.667 12 5\n3.333 2.667 6.667 9 10 19 6.667 24.667 20.333 43.667 41 57 7.333 4.667 11\n10.667 11 18 0 6-1 10-3 12s-6.667 5-14 9c-28.667 14.667-53.667 35.667-75 63\n-1.333 1.333-3.167 3.5-5.5 6.5s-4 4.833-5 5.5c-1 .667-2.5 1.333-4.5 2s-4.333 1\n-7 1c-4.667 0-9.167-1.833-13.5-5.5S337 184 337 178c0-12.667 15.667-32.333 47-59\nH213l-171-1c-8.667-6-13-12.333-13-19 0-4.667 4.333-11.333 13-20h359\nc-16-25.333-24-45-24-59z\"/></svg></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1944em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 整段线段做射线或扫掠查询，覆盖全路径故不漏；这是数据模型保留上一帧位置的目的。</li>\n<li>检测按需分层：慢速用离散点、快速小弹用射线 CCD、有体积用扫掠、高速急转用子步进；Unreal PMC 对重力/追踪弹自动子步进。</li>\n<li>检测到几何命中后还要处理碰撞过滤、忽略发射者防自伤、枪口 vs 摄像机的瞄准起点等投射物特有问题。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"延伸阅读\">延伸阅读</h2><ul>\n<li>同章：<a href=\"penetration-ricochet\">穿透与跳弹</a> —— CCD 报告命中后，如何决定停止、穿透还是反弹。</li>\n<li>同章：<a href=\"damage-falloff\">伤害衰减</a> —— 命中点确定后如何结算伤害。</li>\n<li>基础章：<a href=\"../foundations/projectile-model\">数据模型</a> —— <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>p</mi><mo>⃗</mo></mover><mrow><mi>p</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>v</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\vec{p}_{prev}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0001em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.714em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.1522em;\"><span class=\"overlay\" style=\"height:0.714em;width:0.471em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"0.471em\" height=\"0.714em\" style=\"width:0.471em\" viewBox=\"0 0 471 714\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMinYMin\"><path d=\"M377 20c0-5.333 1.833-10 5.5-14S391 0 397 0c4.667 0 8.667 1.667 12 5\n3.333 2.667 6.667 9 10 19 6.667 24.667 20.333 43.667 41 57 7.333 4.667 11\n10.667 11 18 0 6-1 10-3 12s-6.667 5-14 9c-28.667 14.667-53.667 35.667-75 63\n-1.333 1.333-3.167 3.5-5.5 6.5s-4 4.833-5 5.5c-1 .667-2.5 1.333-4.5 2s-4.333 1\n-7 1c-4.667 0-9.167-1.833-13.5-5.5S337 184 337 178c0-12.667 15.667-32.333 47-59\nH213l-171-1c-8.667-6-13-12.333-13-19 0-4.667 4.333-11.333 13-20h359\nc-16-25.333-24-45-24-59z\"/></svg></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1944em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 与发射者 ID 为本篇检测服务。</li>\n<li>跨库：<a href=\"../../game-physics/collision-detection/continuous-detection\">游戏物理 · 连续碰撞检测</a> —— CCD 算法本身的底层原理。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"投射物碰撞：连续检测与穿墙的隐蔽 bug","id":"投射物碰撞-连续检测与穿墙的隐蔽-bug"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：隧穿，离散检测的致命缺陷","id":"核心概念-隧穿-离散检测的致命缺陷"},{"level":2,"text":"连续碰撞检测：检查整段路径","id":"连续碰撞检测-检查整段路径"},{"level":2,"text":"检测策略的层次与取舍","id":"检测策略的层次与取舍"},{"level":2,"text":"该撞谁：过滤、自伤与首帧问题","id":"该撞谁-过滤-自伤与首帧问题"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"},{"level":2,"text":"延伸阅读","id":"延伸阅读"}],"prev":{"title":"制导与追踪：飞行中主动修正航向","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-projectile-ballistics/motion/homing-guidance"},"next":{"title":"穿透与跳弹：命中之后的物理分支","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-projectile-ballistics/collision/penetration-ricochet"}}